Conversational playground, prompt evaluator, and multi-modal AI workflow studio built for engineers and machine learning product teams.

## Designing for Probabilistic Output

Generative systems break the classic mental model of software: the same input can produce different outputs. The interface had to make uncertainty legible without eroding trust — streaming responses token by token, exposing confidence signals, and giving users levers to steer regeneration instead of a dead-end retry.

We treated every prompt as a living document. Versioning, side-by-side comparison, and inline evaluation rubrics turned prompt engineering from a guessing game into a measurable craft.

## What Shipped

- Conversational playground with streaming responses and editable history branches
- Prompt evaluator with rubric-based scoring and regression snapshots
- Multi-modal workflow canvas connecting models, tools, and human review steps

Weekly active retention grew by 22% after the revamped prompt engineering editor shipped.
